azure-folio for the niri desktop (ackerman): DMS, Folio's fallback, takes the
plate and the fonts from azure-folio again, as on archive/interstellar-niri.
With DMS running, the plate goes to it over IPC (FolioSync's folioWallpaper),
cropped for each display, and `refresh-wallpapers` re-crops it when displays
change; with Folio running, it is staged in DMS's session for its next start.
Main's version sets GNOME's wallpaper instead. themeport is main's, so the look
command takes no --no-restart.

Applied by modules/nixos/niri-folio.nix to packages/azure-folio.nix's copy.

